even if you shared them.

341
00:14:43,132 --> 00:14:44,425
Yeah, that's why I shared…

342
00:14:44,508 --> 00:14:45,968
- Wait, did I not?
- No, not yet.

343
00:14:50,055 --> 00:14:51,682
<i>Your time is up.</i>

344
00:14:51,765 --> 00:14:54,643
<i>Lay the Grass will now begin.</i>

345
00:14:54,727 --> 00:14:56,312
<i>The grass tile selection order</i>

346
00:14:56,395 --> 00:14:59,106
