362
00:15:33,766 --> 00:15:34,850
What's your strategy?

363
00:15:34,934 --> 00:15:36,268
Everyone scoring?

364
00:15:36,352 --> 00:15:38,520
- I need at least sixth place.
- Right.

365
00:15:39,229 --> 00:15:43,108
- Will my score be affected?
- You just need to do as I say.

366
00:15:43,192 --> 00:15:45,569
- Choose defend, and cut two squares.
- Okay.

367
00:15:45,653 --> 00:15:47,488
Go with tile 9.

368
00:15:47,571 --> 00:15:50,282
And then attack with trees.

369
00:15:51,825 --> 00:15:54,078
