406
00:17:14,283 --> 00:17:16,869
- Nucksal, please select a grass tile.
- I'll get tile 9, then.

407
00:17:17,870 --> 00:17:19,538
I'll select tile 9.

408
00:17:19,621 --> 00:17:21,874
Nucksal, you have selected tile 9.

409
00:17:21,957 --> 00:17:22,791
Tile 9.

410
00:17:22,875 --> 00:17:24,251
- You have selected tile 9.
- Thank you.

411
00:17:24,752 --> 00:17:26,587
- They all chose tile 9.
- All of them?

412
00:17:26,670 --> 00:17:28,672
John Park, you have selected tile 9.

413
00:17:28,756 --> 00:17:30,549
John, you went for tile 9?

414
00:17:30,632 --> 00:17:31,467
- Tile 9 for now.
- As expected.

415
00:17:32,051 --> 00:17:32,968
I'll select tile 9.

416
00:17:33,052 --> 00:17:35,095
JAE JAE, you have selected tile 9.

417
00:17:35,179 --> 00:17:37,306
XITSUH, you have selected tile 9.

418
00:17:37,890 --> 00:17:38,974
Tile 9?

419
00:17:39,058 --> 00:17:41,935
<i>I couldn't understand why they chose</i>
<i>tile 9 despite their low priority ranking.</i>

420
00:17:42,019 --> 00:17:44,980
<i>Especially JAE JAE. She was in 16th place.</i>

421
00:17:45,064 --> 00:17:47,107
If they choose the same tile as Yi Do,

422
00:17:47,191 --> 00:17:48,609
then they can't keep her in check.

423
00:17:48,692 --> 00:17:50,944
<i>Grass tiles are placed in order,</i>

424
00:17:51,028 --> 00:17:54,448
<i>starting with the lowest tile number.</i>

425
00:17:55,949 --> 00:17:58,160
<i>If tile numbers are tied,</i>

426
00:17:58,243 --> 00:18:00,829
<i>the player with a higher priority ranking</i>
<i>places first.</i>

427
00:18:01,538 --> 00:18:03,749
<i>Here are the priority rankings</i>
<i>of the players</i>

428
00:18:03,832 --> 00:18:05,793
<i>who've selected tile 9 so far.</i>

429
00:18:05,876 --> 00:18:08,045
<i>Yi Do is 11th.</i>

430
00:18:08,128 --> 00:18:11,423
<i>If the goal of the greater good alliance</i>
<i>is to keep her in check,</i>

431
00:18:11,507 --> 00:18:14,218
<i>its members should have selected</i>
<i>lower-numbered tiles than hers</i>

432
00:18:14,301 --> 00:18:17,179
<i>so they can place their tiles before her.</i>

433
00:18:17,262 --> 00:18:19,723
Why did all those people select tile 9
when Yi Do outranks them

434
00:18:19,807 --> 00:18:21,100
