436
00:18:23,811 --> 00:18:25,771
- No, she's not.
- Then who's last?

437
00:18:25,854 --> 00:18:26,688
JAE JAE.

438
00:18:28,107 --> 00:18:29,650
<i>That was my mistake.</i>

439
00:18:29,733 --> 00:18:32,277
I thought Yi Do was last,
but it turns out she wasn't.

440
00:18:32,361 --> 00:18:37,324
<i>Nucksal and JAE JAE</i>
<i>had lower priority ranking than Yi Do.</i>

441
00:18:37,407 --> 00:18:38,784
But how could they

442
00:18:39,451 --> 00:18:40,994
