443
00:18:41,912 --> 00:18:44,081
- You can't save everyone on your team.
- Yeah.

444
00:18:46,333 --> 00:18:49,503
<i>I regret it a lot.</i>
<i>I should've gone for a lower number.</i>

445
00:18:49,586 --> 00:18:51,505
I just didn't think it through.

446
00:18:51,588 --> 00:18:53,549
My low priority ranking is an issue.

447
00:18:54,341 --> 00:18:55,926
Should I have gone for tile 7?

448
00:18:56,009 --> 00:18:57,344
<i>Man, I'm screwed.</i>

449
00:18:58,595 --> 00:19:00,055
