450
00:19:00,556 --> 00:19:02,558
<i>Obviously, higher points</i>
<i>are always more appealing.</i>

451
00:19:02,641 --> 00:19:05,727
<i>Thinking that they could</i>
<i>at least beat Yi Do,</i>

452
00:19:05,811 --> 00:19:08,981
