There was a string of that.

454
00:19:10,524 --> 00:19:12,401
<i>The funny thing about being a team</i>

455
00:19:12,484 --> 00:19:14,278
<i>is that no one would feel comfortable</i>

456
00:19:14,361 --> 00:19:17,281
