457
00:19:17,364 --> 00:19:20,117
That'd be as good as saying,
"Let me get ahead of you."

458
00:19:20,200 --> 00:19:21,160
That's how things are.

459
00:19:21,243 --> 00:19:22,953
Next, Yurisa.

460
00:19:23,036 --> 00:19:24,746
I'll select tile 6.

461
00:19:26,832 --> 00:19:28,125
My priority ranking is gutter.

462
00:19:28,208 --> 00:19:30,210
<i>I'm in 15th place out of 16.</i>

463
00:19:30,294 --> 00:19:32,004
<i>If there's a tie, I'm 15th in line.</i>

464
00:19:32,087 --> 00:19:34,798
If I choose the same number,
