- This isn't gonna be easy.

485
00:20:17,716 --> 00:20:18,717
GRASS TILE PLACEMENT ORDER

486
00:20:18,800 --> 00:20:19,635
Not easy at all.

487
00:20:19,718 --> 00:20:21,803
- No wonder tile 7 was calling me.
- It called me too.

488
00:20:21,887 --> 00:20:23,388
<i>Before the grass tiles are placed,</i>

489
00:20:23,472 --> 00:20:25,766
