to make sure you can place your tile,

499
00:20:50,082 --> 00:20:51,541
- but our turn comes early.
- Yeah.

500
00:20:51,625 --> 00:20:53,502
We can probably pull it off.

501
00:20:53,585 --> 00:20:57,172
And we're starting with six points,
so if we succeed, we'll be plus six.

502
00:20:57,256 --> 00:20:59,716
Man, Team Greater Good is becoming a joke.

503
00:20:59,800 --> 00:21:01,510
We actually ended up in the safe zone.

504
00:21:01,593 --> 00:21:02,469
Right?

505
00:21:03,220 --> 00:21:05,639
- I think Yi Do is in danger.
- Yeah.

506
00:21:05,722 --> 00:21:07,641
She was testing the waters too much.

507
00:21:07,724 --> 00:21:09,810
She believed she had the upper hand.

508
00:21:10,727 --> 00:21:11,853
Too bad.

509
00:21:11,937 --> 00:21:13,939
- We should go for defend.
- Yeah.

510
00:21:14,022 --> 00:21:15,941
But our numbers are unfortunate.

511
00:21:16,024 --> 00:21:17,192
- I know, right?
- Yeah.

512
00:21:17,276 --> 00:21:19,319
