<i>have completed their selections.</i>

514
00:21:23,031 --> 00:21:23,949
SELECTION 6

515
00:21:24,032 --> 00:21:26,618
<i>We will now begin the seventh selection.</i>

516
00:21:26,702 --> 00:21:28,662
<i>Players who choose mutual benefit</i>

517
00:21:28,745 --> 00:21:31,748
<i>must team up with another player.</i>

518
00:21:31,832 --> 00:21:34,584
<i>If both players</i>
<i>successfully place their tiles,</i>

519
00:21:34,668 --> 00:21:38,088
<i>they will earn bonus points</i>
<i>equal to the number of sides</i>

520
00:21:38,171 --> 00:21:39,798
<i>where their tiles touch.</i>

521
00:21:39,881 --> 00:21:42,092
<i>Players who choose rivalry</i>

522
00:21:42,175 --> 00:21:45,971
<i>will earn five bonus points</i>
<i>when nine or fewer players</i>

523
00:21:46,054 --> 00:21:48,598
<i>have successfully placed their tiles.</i>

524
00:21:48,682 --> 00:21:52,102
<i>The player must also successfully</i>
<i>place their own tile</i>

525
00:21:52,185 --> 00:21:54,187
<i>to earn the bonus points.</i>

526
00:21:54,271 --> 00:21:57,482
