at this point anyway.

534
00:22:13,206 --> 00:22:15,709
- Mutual benefit is impossible.
- My tile placement isn't even guaranteed.

535
00:22:15,792 --> 00:22:16,668
It's not gonna work.

536
00:22:16,752 --> 00:22:18,378
I'll choose rivalry.

537
00:22:18,462 --> 00:22:19,963
I'll choose rivalry.

538
00:22:20,047 --> 00:22:22,174
I choose rivalry.

539
00:22:22,257 --> 00:22:24,343
Dong-min and I will choose mutual benefit.

540
00:22:24,426 --> 00:22:25,886
Jung Won-young and Jang Dong-min,

541
00:22:25,969 --> 00:22:27,554
