and formed a team.

542
00:22:27,637 --> 00:22:29,890
Mutual benefit is the only possibility.

543
00:22:29,973 --> 00:22:34,353
When it's our turn, there's no way
there will be fewer than nine grass tiles.

544
00:22:34,436 --> 00:22:36,271
- Mutual benefit is the only option.
- Right.

545
00:22:36,355 --> 00:22:38,565
- This sucks.
- Damn it.

546
00:22:38,648 --> 00:22:41,651
- This is nuts. I keep making bad choices.
- Nucksal.

547
00:22:41,735 --> 00:22:43,695
- You took the words right out of my mouth.
- Damn it.

548
00:22:43,779 --> 00:22:46,782
<i>All players</i>
<i>have completed their selections.</i>

549
00:22:47,574 --> 00:22:50,035
<i>We will now begin the eighth selection.</i>

550
00:22:50,827 --> 00:22:52,704
<i>Players who choose tree</i>

551
00:22:52,788 --> 00:22:56,833
<i>will place a tree on the park board</i>
<i>before the grass tiles are placed.</i>

552
00:22:56,917 --> 00:22:58,794
They're so cute.

553
00:22:58,877 --> 00:22:59,878
Trees.

554
00:23:01,129 --> 00:23:03,256
So they fit in right here.

555
00:23:03,340 --> 00:23:08,512
<i>Players who choose manholes will place</i>
<i>one +1 manhole and one -1 manhole</i>

556
00:23:08,595 --> 00:23:10,514
<i>on the park board</i>
<i>before the grass tiles are placed.</i>

557
00:23:10,597 --> 00:23:12,516
The fact is,

558
00:23:12,599 --> 00:23:14,851
