starting from the 6th turn.

560
00:23:18,188 --> 00:23:21,066
The 11 of us
need to maximize our placement.

561
00:23:21,149 --> 00:23:24,569
Choosing tree and blocking
will only work against that.

562
00:23:24,653 --> 00:23:26,530
- It'll be basically done after us.
- Of course.

563
00:23:26,613 --> 00:23:28,073
There'll be almost no room.

564
00:23:28,740 --> 00:23:29,741
Let's go with the tree.

565
00:23:30,242 --> 00:23:32,285
- I'll choose manholes.
- Manholes?

566
00:23:32,369 --> 00:23:35,789
It's better to stop them from scoring
than to get extra points ourselves.

567
00:23:35,872 --> 00:23:37,999
Additional placement
might not even be possible.

568
00:23:38,083 --> 00:23:40,252
A tree there will stop them.

569
00:23:40,335 --> 00:23:41,670
We won't be able to place either.

570
00:23:41,753 --> 00:23:43,004
That's not true.

571
00:23:43,088 --> 00:23:44,005
We'll be cutting.

572
00:23:44,089 --> 00:23:46,091
- And they won't be.
- Yeah.

573
00:23:46,174 --> 00:23:49,636
- That will be their issue. We'll be fine.
- You added that to your calculation?

574
00:23:49,719 --> 00:23:52,514
<i>All players</i>
<i>have completed their selections.</i>

575
00:23:52,597 --> 00:23:53,557
