576
00:23:53,640 --> 00:23:57,227
<i>Players will now place the trees</i>
<i>and manholes on the park board.</i>

577
00:23:57,310 --> 00:23:59,688
First up, Jung Won-young.
Please place your manholes.

578
00:24:03,358 --> 00:24:04,401
This is fun.

579
