Please place your manholes.

597
00:24:48,028 --> 00:24:49,821
Next, Ha Seok-jin.

598
00:24:49,905 --> 00:24:51,323
Next, XITSUH.

599
00:24:51,406 --> 00:24:53,617
Next, Oh Hyun-min.
Please place your manholes.

600
00:24:53,700 --> 00:24:55,118
Next, Stella Jang.

601
00:24:55,202 --> 00:24:57,120
John Park, please place your manholes.

602
00:24:57,204 --> 00:24:58,705
