- Yeah.

606
00:25:04,294 --> 00:25:06,004
Unless they're targeting someone.

607
00:25:06,087 --> 00:25:08,423
Next, Yi Do. Please place your manholes.

608
00:25:08,507 --> 00:25:10,967
Next, Nucksal. Please place your manholes.

609
00:25:11,051 --> 00:25:12,093
Next, JAE JAE.

610
00:25:12,886 --> 00:25:15,388
<i>- All the manholes have been placed.</i>
<i>- </i>Okay.

611
00:25:15,472 --> 00:25:17,307
<i>- The trees will now be placed.</i>
- Next, trees.

612
00:25:17,390 --> 00:25:19,392
- Yurisa, can--
- Kim Dong-jae, please place your tree.

613
00:25:19,476 --> 00:25:21,019
