- Sure.

614
00:25:21,603 --> 00:25:22,896
How does this work?

615
00:25:23,813 --> 00:25:25,148
- That doesn't work.
- Tile 6?

616
00:25:25,232 --> 00:25:26,942
- I think it was like this.
- Like this?

617
00:25:28,026 --> 00:25:29,236
- Like this?
- Yeah.

618
00:25:30,195 --> 00:25:32,322
Why did our strategy turn out like this?

619
00:25:33,406 --> 00:25:37,494
Could we not have chosen tile 3
after Yi Do made her choice?

620
00:25:37,577 --> 00:25:39,621
This is one long game,

621
00:25:39,704 --> 00:25:41,706
