629
00:26:09,651 --> 00:26:11,778
We might have to.

630
00:26:11,861 --> 00:26:12,946
But if I'm left in prison,

631
00:26:13,029 --> 00:26:15,740
I'll be in a situation
where I've linked you two up,

632
00:26:15,824 --> 00:26:17,409
