with no connections.

633
00:26:17,492 --> 00:26:18,368
No, no.

634
00:26:19,077 --> 00:26:21,246
It's not like Hyun-min
to say such a thing.

635
00:26:21,830 --> 00:26:26,501
I don't know what's spooking him,
but he's asking me to save him.

636
00:26:26,585 --> 00:26:28,587
I'll have to wait and see.

637
00:26:28,670 --> 00:26:31,006
- Next, Hyun Kyung-lyul.
- One more?

638
00:26:31,089 --> 00:26:33,633
I have to figure out another spot.

639
00:26:36,177 --> 00:26:37,554
