641
00:26:40,015 --> 00:26:43,226
- Right. I guess they'll go for this setup.
- This way, more sides touch.

642
00:26:43,310 --> 00:26:44,978
- I think they would do this.
- Like this?

643
00:26:45,061 --> 00:26:47,022
- It's in the far corner.
- Most sides touch that way.

644
00:26:47,105 --> 00:26:49,608
- And it's on the side to help the rest.
- It's not bad.

645
00:26:50,358 --> 00:26:53,153
- Then should I place it here?
- Do you not wanna block the others?

646
00:26:53,236 --> 00:26:54,571
This will stop them.

647
00:26:54,654 --> 00:26:55,864
He planted it.

648
00:26:55,947 --> 00:26:57,157
It's planted, right?

649
00:26:59,117 --> 00:27:00,452
Okay, okay.

650
00:27:00,535 --> 00:27:02,996
- The center might be better.
- Right.

651
00:27:04,122 --> 00:27:05,832
- Right there. Okay.
- I'll plant it here.

652
00:27:05,915 --> 00:27:08,209
Next, Jeong Hyun-gyu.
Please plant your tree.

653
00:27:08,835 --> 00:27:09,711
Seok-jin.

654
00:27:10,211 --> 00:27:11,880
