918
00:37:11,854 --> 00:37:13,189
<i>Straight flush.</i>

919
00:37:14,023 --> 00:37:14,899
<i>Four of a kind.</i>

920
00:37:15,733 --> 00:37:16,734
<i>Full house.</i>

921
00:37:17,526 --> 00:37:18,444
<i>Flush.</i>

922
00:37:19,153 --> 00:37:20,279
<i>Straight.</i>

923
00:37:21,030 --> 00:37:21,864
<i>Three of a kind.</i>

924
00:37:22,823 --> 00:37:23,741
<i>Two pair.</i>

925
00:37:24,533 --> 00:37:25,493
<i>One pair.</i>

926
00:37:26,410 --> 00:37:28,162
<i>And lastly, high card.</i>

927
00:37:28,246 --> 00:37:29,205
