986
00:40:20,501 --> 00:40:21,961
JOHN PARK
OPTION 1: CHALLENGE

987
00:40:22,044 --> 00:40:26,841
If the ladder method gets chosen,
I have to play right away.

988
00:40:26,924 --> 00:40:30,136
