995
00:40:42,481 --> 00:40:44,525
- We…
- We should choose option two.

996
00:40:44,608 --> 00:40:45,568
Of course, option two.

997
00:40:45,651 --> 00:40:48,446
- We need to choose option two.
- Option two for sure. One is a no-go.

998
00:40:48,529 --> 00:40:52,324
I believe most chose the ladder method

999
00:40:52,408 --> 00:40:54,702
to avoid being chosen to play.

1000
00:40:54,785 --> 00:40:56,537
In the ladder method,

1001
00:40:56,620 --> 00:40:59,457
