one-on-one from the bottom,

1002
00:40:59,540 --> 00:41:02,585
<i>so the chances of them reaching me</i>
<i>are pretty low.</i>

1003
00:41:02,668 --> 00:41:04,086
JANG DONG-MIN
OPTION 2: LADDER

1004
00:41:04,170 --> 00:41:05,588
HONG JIN-HO
OPTION 2: LADDER

1005
00:41:05,671 --> 00:41:07,047
OH HYUN-MIN
OPTION 2: LADDER

1006
00:41:07,131 --> 00:41:13,179
If Dong-min loses first place,
XITSUH and I would be losing our lifeline,

1007
00:41:13,262 --> 00:41:15,431
<i>regardless of who</i>
<i>Dong-min decides to save.</i>

1008
00:41:15,514 --> 00:41:18,434
<i>All players</i>
<i>have completed their selections.</i>

1009
00:41:18,517 --> 00:41:22,313
<i>The majority of the players</i>
<i>have chosen the ladder method.</i>

1010
00:41:22,396 --> 00:41:24,440
<i>The first match will be between</i>

1011
00:41:24,523 --> 00:41:30,237
<i>15th-place Nucksal, the challenger,</i>
<i>and 14th-place JAE JAE.</i>

1012
00:41:30,321 --> 00:41:32,364
I thought it was worth a shot.

1013
00:41:32,448 --> 00:41:34,325
<i>I was in 15th place,</i>
<i>and JAE JAE was in 14th.</i>

1014
00:41:34,408 --> 00:41:37,161
I thought I had a chance
as long as I remained calm.

1015
00:41:37,244 --> 00:41:39,330
- This is insane.
- Let's both make it up there.

1016
00:41:39,413 --> 00:41:40,539
- Let's go.
- All right.

1017
00:41:40,623 --> 00:41:42,249
- Anywhere but here.
- Sure.

1018
