1070
00:45:18,465 --> 00:45:22,761
<i>Nucksal, your next opponent is John Park.</i>

1071
00:45:22,845 --> 00:45:24,763
- Good luck.
<i>- Please make your way to the hall.</i>

1072
00:45:26,682 --> 00:45:28,267
- Hey.
- John.

1073
00:45:28,350 --> 00:45:29,226
Welcome.

1074
00:45:29,309 --> 00:45:31,812
- You're good.
- I'm getting confident.

1075
00:45:31,895 --> 00:45:32,813
Oh dear.

1076
