<i>Seventh place was my goal.</i>
<i>I might as well survive now.</i>

1077
00:45:40,070 --> 00:45:43,282
<i>Poker isn't key here.</i>

1078
00:45:43,365 --> 00:45:44,700
<i>Memorization is.</i>

1079
00:45:44,783 --> 00:45:48,787
