1080
00:45:48,871 --> 00:45:50,497
Here are the cards.

1081
00:45:54,209 --> 00:45:55,544
<i>I decided to stick with my strategy.</i>

1082
00:45:55,627 --> 00:45:58,714
<i>I'm gonna memorize</i>
<i>the best cards in the set,</i>

1083
00:45:58,797 --> 00:46:01,091
