1092
00:46:46,512 --> 00:46:47,888
A pair of twos…

1093
00:46:47,971 --> 00:46:49,139
Whatever.

1094
00:46:54,311 --> 00:46:56,814
- Have you placed your markers?
- Yes.

1095
00:46:57,314 --> 00:46:58,190
Yes.

1096
00:47:02,110 --> 00:47:04,655
John Park, you have won with two pair,
