1097
00:47:04,738 --> 00:47:08,575
NUCKSAL: ACE, HIGH
JOHN PARK: TWO PAIR, FIVES OVER THREES

1098
00:47:09,535 --> 00:47:12,579
- He memorized them all.
- Nucksal, your streak has ended.

1099
00:47:13,580 --> 00:47:15,707
