STREAK ENDED

1102
00:47:21,672 --> 00:47:24,174
<i>Yi Do, 16th-place player,</i>

1103
00:47:24,258 --> 00:47:26,635
<i>your winning-streak game will now begin.</i>

1104
00:47:26,718 --> 00:47:27,845
- Good luck.
- Good luck.

1105
00:47:27,928 --> 00:47:30,305
<i>You will face</i>
<i>the 15th-place player, JAE JAE.</i>

1106
00:47:31,515 --> 00:47:33,642
<i>Yi Do and JAE JAE,</i>

1107
00:47:34,393 --> 00:47:35,686
