1113
00:47:47,531 --> 00:47:49,241
<i>I just wanna avoid elimination.</i>

1114
00:47:49,324 --> 00:47:51,660
All I want is 14th place.

1115
00:47:51,743 --> 00:47:54,204
Being eliminated in 16th place
rather than 15th

1116
00:47:54,288 --> 00:47:56,081
