1138
00:49:39,601 --> 00:49:41,395
<i>There were a lot of games today,</i>

1139
00:49:41,478 --> 00:49:43,814
<i>and I just never excelled in any of them.</i>

1140
00:49:43,897 --> 00:49:46,525
<i>So how could I not be eliminated?</i>

1141
00:49:46,608 --> 00:49:50,028
So I'm disappointed,
but I just have to accept it.

1142
00:49:50,696 --> 00:49:52,698
YI DO
STREAK ENDED

1143
00:49:52,781 --> 00:49:54,825
