1144
00:49:54,908 --> 00:49:58,996
<i>As the new 15th-place player,</i>
<i>JAE JAE must continue playing.</i>

1145
00:49:59,079 --> 00:50:01,832
<i>JAE JAE's opponent is Nucksal.</i>

1146
00:50:03,208 --> 00:50:04,292
<i>- Nucksal,</i>
<i>- </i>How interesting.

1147
00:50:04,376 --> 00:50:06,586
<i>- please make your way to the hall.</i>
- Okay.

1148
00:50:06,670 --> 00:50:07,671
