1150
00:50:09,423 --> 00:50:10,549
Wow.

1151
00:50:10,632 --> 00:50:11,758
You were good.

1152
00:50:11,842 --> 00:50:13,176
- Not at all.
- Come on.

1153
00:50:13,260 --> 00:50:14,970
- You lied about having bad memory.
