1155
00:50:18,515 --> 00:50:20,267
Let's have a good game.

1156
00:50:21,226 --> 00:50:22,394
Let's go!

1157
00:50:22,477 --> 00:50:26,189
<i>The loser of this match</i>
<i>will be eliminated in 15th place.</i>

1158
00:50:26,690 --> 00:50:31,278
<i>If JAE JAE wins,</i>
<i>she will continue playing.</i>

1159
00:50:31,361 --> 00:50:32,612
<i>If Nucksal wins,</i>

1160
